@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@listId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000030
@itemId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### 创建出行清单，替换真实衣物 ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "周末短途行李",
  "destination": "杭州",
  "start_date": "2026-11-21",
  "end_date": "2026-11-22",
  "item_ids": ["{{itemId}}"],
  "packed_item_ids": []
}

### 清单列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists

### 查看清单
GET {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{listId}}

### 将衣物记录为已装箱
PUT {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{listId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "周末短途行李",
  "destination": "杭州",
  "start_date": "2026-11-21",
  "end_date": "2026-11-22",
  "item_ids": ["{{itemId}}"],
  "packed_item_ids": ["{{itemId}}"]
}

### 删除清单，不删除衣物
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/packing-lists/{{listId}}
